From 1f21818e9a061b1a77adca3352ac264c94fb3099 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guilhem Bichot <guilhem.bichot@contributor>

Date: Tue, 15 Apr 2025 10:42:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Port of MySQL feature "session plan cache"

( = FEATURE ; original feature reference in MySQL: FEATURE)

Please see the long comment added at the beginning of
sql/sql_plan_cache.cc for a summary of what has been done and how to
best review this.

Aside from porting, we also enable plan cache if there is a scalar
uncorrelated subquery (both query blocks, top and subquery, can be cached).
